{"unit_id":"tag:09YR:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为层（sheaf），其值为集合（sets）、阿贝尔群（abelian groups）或<MATH_0003>-模（modules）（其中<MATH_0004>为 Noether（Noetherian）的），定义于<MATH_0005>上。若存在可构造（constructible）的局部闭子概形（closed subschemes）<MATH_0006>，使得(a)<MATH_0007>且(b)<MATH_0008>可构造（constructible），则<MATH_0009>可构造（constructible）。\n","allowed_english":["Noether"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"Noether"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"closed subschemes","target_term":"局部闭子概形"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"Noether","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"closed subschemes","target_term":"局部闭子概形","context":"原文以 locally 修饰；暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:09YR:proof","translation":"首先可以假设覆盖（covering）有限（finite），因为<MATH_0001>在谱（spectral）拓扑（topology）中拟紧（quasi-compact）（拓扑（Topology），引理<REF_0001>以及性质（Properties），引理<REF_0002>）。注意，每个<MATH_0002>自身为拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的概形（scheme）（因为它在<MATH_0003>中可构造（constructible）；细节略）。因此可以找到有限（finite）划分（partition）<MATH_0004>，其各部分局部闭（locally closed）且可构造（constructible），属于<MATH_0005>，使得<MATH_0006>有限（finite）且局部常值（locally constant）（引理<REF_0003>）。由拓扑（Topology），引理<REF_0004>，可知<MATH_0007>是可构造（constructible）的局部闭子概形（closed subscheme），属于<MATH_0008>。于是可应用拓扑（Topology），引理<REF_0005>于<MATH_0009>，找到所需划分（partition），对应于<MATH_0010>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"spectral","target_term":"谱"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"Properties","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分"},{"source_term":"locally closed","target_term":"局部闭"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"局部闭子概形"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"spectral","target_term":"谱","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":