{"unit_id":"tag:095F:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。检查可构造性（constructibility），对于层（sheaf），其值为集合（sets）、阿贝尔群（abelian groups）或<MATH_0002>-模（modules）（其中<MATH_0003>为 Noether（Noetherian）的），可以在<MATH_0004>上 Zariski 局部进行。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski","Noether"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"constructibility","target_term":"可构造性"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"Noether"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"constructibility","target_term":"可构造性","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"Noether","context":"暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:095F:proof","translation":"该断言是说，若<MATH_0001>为开（open）覆盖（covering），使得<MATH_0002>可构造（constructible），则<MATH_0003>可构造（constructible）。若<MATH_0004>为仿射开集（affine open），则<MATH_0005>且<MATH_0006>可构造（constructible）（限制（restriction），对于可构造（constructible）层（sheaf）到开集（open）而言，是可构造（constructible）的，这是平凡的）。由引理<REF_0001>可得<MATH_0007>可构造（constructible），即存在合适的划分（partition），对应于<MATH_0008>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开集"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开","context":"覆盖的修饰词；暂译。"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开集","context":"开子集；暂译。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分","context":"暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:095G:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为态射（morphism），其两端为概形（schemes）。若<MATH_0002>为可构造（constructible）层（sheaf），其值为集合（sets）、阿贝尔群（abelian groups）或<MATH_0003>-模（modules）（其中<MATH_0004>为 Noether（Noetherian）的），定义于<MATH_0005>上，则同样的性质对<MATH_0006>在<MATH_0007>上成立。\n","allowed_english":["Noether"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"Noether"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"Noether","context":"暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:095G:proof","translation":"由引理<REF_0001>，归约到<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>均仿射（affine）的情形。由引理<REF_0002>，只须找到有限（finite）划分（partition），对应于<MATH_0003>，其各项为可构造（constructible）的局部闭子概形（closed subschemes），使得<MATH_0004>在每一项上有限（finite）且局部常值（locally constant）。为此，只须拉回（pull back）划分（partition），对应于<MATH_0005>并适配于<MATH_0006>，再使用引理<REF_0003>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"closed subschemes","target_term":"局部闭子概形"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"pull back","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"closed subschemes","target_term":"局部闭子概形","context":"原文以 locally 修饰；暂译。"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"pull back","target_term":"拉回","context":"暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
