{"unit_id":"tag:03RZ:proof","translation":"我们证明(3)。将使用同调（Homology），引理<REF_0001>的判据。假设<MATH_0001>为映射（map），其两端为可构造层（constructible sheaves），其值为<MATH_0002>-模（modules）。必须说明<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>可构造（constructible）。类似地，假设\n<MATH_0005>\n为短正合列（short exact sequence），由层（sheaves）组成，其值为<MATH_0006>-模（modules），且<MATH_0007>、<MATH_0008>可构造（constructible）。必须说明<MATH_0009>可构造（constructible）。在两种情形下，均可将<MATH_0010>替换为仿射开集（affine open）覆盖（covering）的各项。因此可假设<MATH_0011>仿射（affine）。再将<MATH_0012>替换为有限（finite）划分（partition）的各项，该划分对应于<MATH_0013>，其各项为可构造（constructible）的局部闭子概形（closed subschemes），且<MATH_0014>和<MATH_0015>在其上均有限型（finite type）且局部常值（locally constant）。于是可应用引理<REF_0002>得出结论。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n(1)和(2)的证明非常类似，略去。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"closed subschemes","target_term":"局部闭子概形"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"constructib